{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20042","headline":"赠黔府王中丞楚 · 孟郊","name":"赠黔府王中丞楚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧说天下山，半在黔中青。\n又闻天下泉，半落黔中鸣。\n山水千万遶，中有君子行。\n儒风一以扇，污俗心皆平。\n我愿中国春，化从异方生。\n昔爲阴草毒，今爲阳华英。\n嘉实缀绿蔓，凉湍泻清声。\n逍遥物景胜，视听空旷幷。\n困骥犹在辕，沉珠尚隐精。\n路遐莫及眄，泥污日已盈。\n岁晏将何从，落叶甘自轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}